  "Notes": {
    "SiteAttribute": "The user attribute that holds a person's site key (e.g. Houses.Mckenzie). extensionAttribute3 was unused on 2026-10-27 (1, 2, 8, 9, 10 are in use). The campus OUs (Sunny Acres, Woodbury) hold several houses' staff together, so a person's house can't be taken from the OU; DynamicGroups builds each PeopleGroup from this attribute instead.",
    "Sites": "Key = <Type>.<Folder name>. SiteOU: the site's OU; UsersOU: relative to SiteOU, where new staff accounts go; Folder: relative to the DATA share; PeopleGroup: the DEPT- group of the site's people (nested into its FLD- groups); DisplayName: also written to the user's Office field (today's Office values are inconsistent, e.g. McKenzie staff have 'Kolton House').",
    "Types": "Defaults per site type. MailboxDatabase from where staff of that type have their mailboxes today (GGIFACILITIES 61, GMHC 87, GGISPENCER 31, GGICORP 21).",
    "Portfolios": "Executive director portfolios: the ED (username) and their sites. DRAFT keys - rename to whatever you call them. Group: an existing DEPT-Campus group for the portfolio. Still unknown: ED for Skylar, Robert Coy, Cookeville and Dayton MHCs, Spencer; Morrison MHC has two staff titled Executive Director (jstotts, ddavis).",
    "Accounts": "Conventions found on 2026-10-27: 185 of 202 staff usernames are first initial + last name; email and UPN the same @generationsgaither.com; Exchange 2019."
  }
